{"sha": "5b167d96121edea44d49a46c02b1ba5c4d94411fcfeba4ac3d465cc85c7bfc81", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:residues} 章 --- 洛朗级数与", "留数定理}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:residues:1}", "$\\frac{\\sin z}z = 1 - \\frac{z^2}6 + \\cdots$：可去奇点，", "留数为 $0$。$\\frac{\\eu^z - 1}{z^2} = \\frac1z + \\frac12 +", "\\frac z6 + \\cdots$：一级极点，留数为 $1$。", "$\\frac1{z(z-1)^2}$：$0$ 处的一级极点，留数为", "$\\frac1{(0-1)^2} = 1$；$1$ 处的二级极点，留数为", "$\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd z}\\bigl(\\frac1z\\bigr)\\big|_{z=1} = -1$.", "$\\frac{\\cos z}{z^3} = \\frac1{z^3} - \\frac1{2z} + \\cdots$：极点，", "阶数为 $3$，留数为 $-\\frac12$。$\\eu^{1/z} = \\sum_{n\\geq0}", "\\frac{z^{-n}}{n!}$：本性奇点，留数为 $1$。$\\frac1{\\sin z}$：", "$n\\pi$ 处为一级极点；留数 $\\frac1{\\cos 0} = 1$，位于 $0$ 处，", "留数 $\\frac1{\\cos\\pi} = -1$，位于 $\\pi$ 处", "（见\\cref{met:b3:residues:compute}，$g/h'$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:residues:2}", "令 $z = \\eu^{\\iu t}$，$\\cos t = \\frac{z + z^{-1}}2$，$\\dd t", "= \\frac{\\dd z}{\\iu z}$:", "\\[", "\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{\\dd t}{a + \\cos t}", "= \\oint_{\\abs z = 1}\\frac{2\\,\\dd z}{\\iu\\,(z^2 + 2az + 1)} .", "\\]", "根 $z_\\pm = -a \\pm \\sqrt{a^2 - 1}$ 满足 $z_+z_- =", "1$，且 $\\abs{z_+} < 1 < \\abs{z_-}$；$z_+$ 处的留数为", "$\\frac{1}{z_+ - z_-} = \\frac1{2\\sqrt{a^2-1}}$，于是积分", "值为 $\\frac2\\iu\\cdot2\\iu\\pi\\cdot\\frac1{2\\sqrt{a^2-1}} =", "\\frac{2\\pi}{\\sqrt{a^2-1}}$。当 $a \\to 1^+$ 时积分趋于无穷（被积函数在", "$t = \\pi$ 处达到峰值）；当 $a \\to \\infty$ 时，积分的行为", "类似 $\\frac{2\\pi}a$，与 $\\int\\frac{\\dd t}a$ 相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:residues:3}", "第一个积分：$\\frac{z^2}{1+z^6}$ 在上半平面的极点为 $p =", "\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/6}, \\iu, \\eu^{5\\iu\\pi/6}$；在每个极点处，", "$\\operatorname{Res} = \\frac{p^2}{6p^5} = \\frac{p^3}{6p^6} =", "-\\frac{p^3}6$，且 $p^3$ 取值 $\\iu, -\\iu, \\iu$：", "留数之和为 $-\\frac{\\iu}{6}$。圆弧部分的贡献为", "$O(R^{-4})\\cdot O(R) \\to 0$:", "\\[", "\\int_\\R\\frac{x^2\\,\\dd x}{1 + x^6} =", "2\\iu\\pi\\Bigl(-\\frac \\iu6\\Bigr) = \\frac\\pi3 .", "\\]", "第二个积分：$\\iu$ 处为二级极点，$\\frac1{(1+z^2)^2} =", "\\frac1{(z-\\iu)^2(z+\\iu)^2}$:", "\\[", "\\operatorname{Res} = \\frac{\\dd}{\\dd z}\\,(z +", "\\iu)^{-2}\\Big|_{z=\\iu} = \\frac{-2}{(2\\iu)^3} =", "\\frac{-2}{-8\\iu} = -\\frac\\iu4,", "\\qquad", "\\int_\\R\\frac{\\dd x}{(1+x^2)^2} =", "2\\iu\\pi\\cdot\\Bigl(-\\frac\\iu4\\Bigr) = \\frac\\pi2 ,", "\\]", "与 \\cref{exo:b3:fouriertransform:3}(b) 一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:residues:4}", "在上半平面内对 $\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu tz}}{z^2 + a^2}$ 取闭合围道", "（$t \\geq 0$）。此时 $\\abs{\\eu^{\\iu tz}} =", "\\eu^{-t\\operatorname{Im}z} \\leq 1$，故圆弧的贡献为", "$O(R^{-2})\\cdot O(R) \\to 0$。被围在内的唯一极点 $\\iu a$", "为一级极点，留数为 $\\frac{\\eu^{-at}}{2\\iu a}$：", "\\[", "\\int_\\R\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu tx}}{x^2 + a^2}\\dd x =", "\\frac{\\pi}{a}\\,\\eu^{-at},", "\\qquad\\text{因此}\\qquad", "\\int_\\R\\frac{\\cos(tx)}{x^2+a^2}\\dd x = \\frac\\pi", "a\\,\\eu^{-a\\abs t}", "\\]", "（取实部；关于 $t$ 为偶函数）。此式是", "$\\widehat{\\eu^{-a\\abs x}} = \\frac{2a}{a^2+\\xi^2}$ 的反演对应", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:fouriertransform:1}）：两种计算", "相互印证，借助", "\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:residues:5}", "部分分式：$f = \\frac1{z-2} - \\frac1{z-1}$。", "在 $\\abs z < 1$ 内（泰勒展开）：", "$f = \\sum_{n\\geq0}\\bigl(1 - 2^{-n-1}\\bigr)z^n$.", "在 $1 < \\abs z < 2$ 内：$\\frac1{z-2} =", "-\\sum_{n\\geq0}\\frac{z^n}{2^{n+1}}$，且 $-\\frac1{z-1} =", "-\\sum_{n\\geq1}z^{-n}$：这是一个真正的双边级数。", "在 $\\abs z > 2$ 内：$f = \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\bigl(2^{n-1} -", "1\\bigr)z^{-n}$。三者不同，原因在于洛朗展开", "依附于\\emph{圆环域}，而非点：每个区域都有", "自身的几何级数展开。$z^{-1}$ 项的系数（分别为 $-1$ 与", "$0$）分别是绕", "\\emph{内部奇点}的圆周积分，而不是 $0$ 处的留数（$f$ 在", "$0$ 处全纯）：对 $1 < \\abs z < 2$，系数", "为 $-1$，即 $\\operatorname{Res}(f, 1)$；对 $\\abs z > 2$，系数", "为 $0$，即 $\\operatorname{Res}(f,1) +", "\\operatorname{Res}(f,2) = -1 + 1$。$f$ 的留数为 $-1$，", "位于 $1$ 处，$+1$ 位于 $2$ 处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:residues:6}", "(a) 洛朗级数 $\\sum_nz^{-n}/n!$ 含有无穷多个", "负幂项，故为本性奇点。解方程 $\\eu^{1/z} = w$（$w \\neq", "0$）：$\\frac1z = \\log\\abs w + \\iu\\arg w + 2\\iu\\pi k$，于是", "\\[", "z_k = \\frac1{\\log\\abs w + \\iu\\arg w + 2\\iu\\pi k}", "\\xrightarrow[k\\to\\infty]{} 0 :", "\\]", "每个非零值在 $0$ 附近都被取到无穷多次 ---", "比稠密性更强。", "(b) 沿 $z = 1/x$，$x \\to +\\infty$：$\\eu^x \\to \\infty$；", "沿 $z = \\iu/y$：模为 $1$。极点要求", "$\\abs{f(z)} \\to \\infty$，\\emph{沿任意趋近方式}：此处", "极限根本不存在，即使在 $[0, +\\infty]$ 中也是如此。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}